flowchart LR
    classDef actor fill:#E8F1FF,stroke:#2563EB,color:#172554,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef source fill:#FFF7ED,stroke:#EA580C,color:#431407,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef app fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#059669,color:#022C22,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef service fill:#F5F3FF,stroke:#7C3AED,color:#2E1065,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef store fill:#F8FAFC,stroke:#475569,color:#0F172A,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef ops fill:#FEFCE8,stroke:#CA8A04,color:#422006,stroke-width:1.5px

    subgraph Users[使用者与权限边界]
        Admin[管理员<br/>用户、工厂授权、全部资产]:::actor
        Engineer[工程师<br/>资产配置、导入、采集任务]:::actor
        Observer[观察者<br/>只读查询与质量查看]:::actor
    end

    subgraph Sources[工业数据源]
        Files[CSV / XLSX<br/>历史宽表或窄表]:::source
        Sim[内置 OPC UA 模拟器<br/>NoSecurity，仅本机演示]:::source
        Real[真实 OPC UA Server<br/>PLC / 网关 / SCADA]:::source
    end

    subgraph Platform[Industrial DataOps Platform]
        Web[React + TypeScript 前端<br/>中文工作台 / 资产 / 治理 / 采集]:::app
        API[FastAPI REST API<br/>JWT、RBAC、工厂级数据权限]:::app
        Asset[工业资产域<br/>工厂 → 产线 → 设备 → 测点]:::service
        Import[数据治理域<br/>预览、映射、校验、去重、质量报告]:::service
        Acquire[实时采集域<br/>浏览、订阅、断线重连、批量写入]:::service
        Query[查询服务<br/>可读视图、最新值、历史趋势]:::service
    end

    subgraph Storage[数据与文件]
        PG[(PostgreSQL 18<br/>业务配置、采集任务、窄表测点样本)]:::store
        EDrive[(E 盘导入源文件<br/>批次目录 + SHA-256)]:::store
        View[(v_tag_sample_readable<br/>UUID → 工厂/设备/测点可读字段)]:::store
    end

    subgraph Runtime[运行与交付]
        Docker[Docker Compose<br/>backend / db / adminer / mail / OPC UA]:::ops
        CI[GitHub Actions<br/>91 个后端测试、覆盖率门禁、4 分片 E2E、安全扫描]:::ops
        Git[GitHub 私有仓库<br/>PR、保护分支、版本标签]:::ops
    end

    Admin --> Web
    Engineer --> Web
    Observer --> Web
    Web -->|HTTPS / JSON| API
    API --> Asset
    API --> Import
    API --> Acquire
    API --> Query
    Files --> Import
    Sim --> Acquire
    Real -. 生产接入需证书与白名单 .-> Acquire
    Asset --> PG
    Import -->|源文件| EDrive
    Import -->|标准化样本与质量问题| PG
    Acquire -->|实时样本与运行状态| PG
    Query --> View
    View --> PG
    Docker --> Platform
    Docker --> Storage
    Git --> CI
    CI -->|校验通过后合并| Git
